{"id":"yxe2b5o1v36wypisxbmzcnyps","title":"石药集团三季报利润翻倍，主要来自一次性授权费","originalTitle":"石药集团刚刚发布了三季报，市场对它的分歧仍然较大","summary":"石药集团（01093.HK）2026年前三季度实现收入252.6亿元，同比增长27.0%，归母溢利70.76亿元，同比增长101.5%，主要来自一笔12亿美元的首付款。剔除授权费后，药品销售稳步增长，原料药和功能食品业务表现分化。后续利润增长将依赖SYS6010等ADC管线。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"钛媒体"},"links":{"original":"https://www.tmtpost.com/8209571.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T05:39:01.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T05:58:33.920Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T05:58:33.920Z","category":"stock-cn","tags":["财报"],"score":40,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"医曜","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"earnings","name":"财报"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}